{"step_index":141,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-30T05:56:54Z","content":"I have added a **Live Notification Bar & Periodic Reminder Engine** to your **Student Survival App 🎓**!\n\n---\n\n### 🔔 What Was Added\n\n#### 1. 📌 Live Sticky Notification Bar (Top Ticker)\n- **Position**: Sits directly underneath the top header, visible on all pages.\n- **Urgency Color-Coding**:\n  - 🔴 **Critical Red**: Overdue work or deadlines due today (<24 hours) with pulsing alert badges.\n  - 🟡 **Warning Amber**: Work due within 2 days or attendance shortages below 75%.\n  - 🟣 **Exam Purple**: Imminent exams within 14 days.\n- **Dynamic Content**: Displays the task name, urgency badge, countdown (*“2 days left”*), and a **“Do It Now 🚀”** quick-jump button that navigates directly to that assignment, attendance calculator, or exam.\n- **Auto-Cycle Progress Line**: Automatically rotates through all your pending tasks every 7 seconds with a smooth visual countdown bar.\n- **Interactive Controls**:\n  - `<` and `>` buttons to manually flip between alerts.\n  - `⏸️` / `▶️` button to pause or resume the auto-cycle.\n  - `✕` button to dismiss the notification bar whenever you want a distraction-free view (you can bring it back anytime by tapping the 🔔 bell icon).\n\n---\n\n#### 2. ⏰ \"Time-to-Time\" Periodic Reminder Engine\n- **Automated Check-ins**: Automatically scans your pending assignments, upcoming exams, and attendance shortages and fires reminders at regular intervals.\n- **Collegiate Humor Audio Alerts**:\n  - Synthesizes a notification chime using the Web Audio API.\n  - Pops up a humorous collegiate check-in banner (e.g., *“🚨 Procrastination Detector Fired: 'DBMS Normalization' is due in 2 days! Don't let future-you suffer. 😭”*).\n- **Customizable Intervals**:\n  - You can adjust the reminder frequency in the Notification Center:\n    - **Every 1 Minute** *(Fast / Demo Mode — perfect for testing right now!)*\n    - **Every 3 Minutes** *(Default)*\n    - **Every 10 Minutes**\n    - **Every 30 Minutes**\n    - **Every 1 Hour**\n- **Desktop Push Notifications (Web Notification API)**:\n  - An **“Enable Desktop Push Notifications 🔔”** toggle allows your browser to send native OS desktop notifications even when you are browsing other tabs or apps.\n- **Instant Test Button**: Tap **“⚡ Trigger Pending Reminder Now”** inside the notification center to test how the reminder looks and sounds immediately.\n\n---\n\n#### 3. 🔔 Header Notification Bell & Notification Center Drawer\n- A **🔔 Bell icon** with a live animated unread alert counter (`3`) is now in the top header.\n- Clicking the bell opens the **Pending Work Notification Center**, which lists all deliverables grouped by urgency with 1-click action buttons to jump straight to that task.\n\n---\n\n### 🚀 How to Test and Run\n\nThe updated app is ready in both locations:\n- 📁 **Workspace**: [`C:\\Users\\DELL\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch\\student-survival-app\\index.html`](file:///C:/Users/DELL/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/student-survival-app/index.html)\n- 📁 **Desktop**: [`C:\\Users\\DELL\\OneDrive\\Desktop\\student survival\\student-survival-app\\index.html`](file:///C:/Users/DELL/OneDrive/Desktop/student%20survival/student-survival-app/index.html)\n\nSimply refresh your browser tab or open **`index.html`** to see the new notification bar and test the periodic reminders!"}
